  "title": "Berkeley Founders’ Pledge, South Bay Meetup",
  "summary": "As a Cal engineering alumnus and a prior founder, it was a delightful opportunity to attend the South Bay Meetup of the Berkeley Founders’ Pledge on Feb. 6, hosted by Bessemer Venture Partners in their new downtown Redwood City office. A roomful of Cal alumni, comprising both current and past entrepreneurs and investors, provided a target rich environment to pick up good vibes on some of the hot trends.",
